    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/7/77032.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 12,
    "turn_text": "Well, before I determined that I couldn't take my country for granted and had to participate as a member of Congress, I was in business and was in the spirits business. My father and I and others introduced Belvedere about vodka back in the early 1990s, establishing an entirely new category of spirits, luxury vodka. before Grey Goose and others and in many ways I have to say and then went on to build the 20 gelato brand which we sold some years ago and in many ways using some of those tactics and techniques and strategies for this upstart renegade and of course as you said long shot campaign for president but I got to tell you Michael everything that I've done in my past life started with selling and selling starts with listening and that's what I'm doing right now all through New Hampshire.",
