    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/7/77032.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 38,
    "turn_text": "Well, I intend to win New Hampshire. I'm going to be competing in Michigan and South Carolina than many states beyond that. I've made it very clear I'm running in the primary for a reason. I will do anything, anything to prevent Donald Trump from becoming our next president. President Biden is not positioned to win the 2024 election. From James Carville to Dave Wasserman to David Ignatius, to most of the most respected and experienced political pundits in the country, national polls have the president down nine points right now, ABC's the latest. He's down in five of six battleground states. The most recent approval data shows him that historic lows, the country is ready for change. He's going to lose to Donald Trump. I am better positioned to win. I'm going to make that case to Democrats. I'm a proud Democrat. I have voted with the president's agenda. I've got some bold new plans that I'll be sharing",
